Hey folks, our numbers currently do not justify having a dedicated
function space room. We might receive a block of time in a room from
some point in the evening, until the next morning. I am fighting to
get what I can for us, but for that to work, I need more of you to
confirm your attendance earlier rather than later.

-Eppcott

P.,S. Arika Okrent plans to attend as well, who some of us met at the
LojbanFest at Philcon. She will be promoting her book "In the Land of
Invented Languages".
P.P.S. We will be recording live, in and about Lojban, for The
Language Creation Society Podcast.


